"""Auto-Me 2.1 - LLM-assisted message rewriter for exteraGram.

Single-file plugin (Python 3.11, Chaquopy). Provides .ai* command family,
multiple style profiles, confirm-before-send dialogs, in-memory LRU cache,
rate limiting, retry/backoff, statistics, import/export, Android-aware
clipboard helpers, EN/RU UI localization and four LLM providers
(Anthropic, OpenAI, GigaChat / Sber, generic OpenAI-compatible).
All blocking work runs via run_on_queue; UI callbacks are wrapped in
try/except so the settings page survives plugin bugs.
"""

